fmodex for Debian
-----------------

The orig tarball (version 4.44.64+1) is the Linux FMOD Ex Programmer's API
4.44.64 (fmodapi44464linux.tar.gz) from Firelight Technologies, repackaged:

 * paths start with ./ (no top-level directory);
 * the SONAME libfmodex.so.4 has been added to libfmodex-4.44.64.so and
   libfmodex64-4.44.64.so (upstream libraries have no SONAME).

There are no sources: only prebuilt libraries, headers, documentation and
examples.

Written by Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>, reviewed by Nicolas HOUDELOT.

